n class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">register</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">available</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>cc @saulecabrera </p>\n</blockquote>",
